.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<typename Var, uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::DataInputVisitor< Var, dim >"Use this visitor to input raw data into model which is assumed to be ordered in input vector by variable components (for example vector v1x, v1y, v1z, v2x\&.\&.\&.) visitor will renumber elements or nodes\&.

